## Brief

**What you already have:** a Next.js site with PostHog set up since 2026-07 (`src/analytics.ts:4`). It records pageviews automatically, including the full URL and its query string. Traffic is about 40 visits a week.

| Request | What it would add | My call |
|---|---|---|
| **Per-application links** | Give each CV its own link, e.g. `yoursite.com/?ref=acme-2026-11`. PostHog already logs the URL, so you can filter by `ref` with no new tracking code. You'd keep a small list matching each ref to an application. | **In.** About an hour of work, and it's the core of what you asked for. |
